sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Terminal
  participant C as Runtime child
  participant F as Restart frontend
  T->>C: Group SIGINT or SIGTERM
  T->>F: Same stop signal
  alt Child exit observed first
    C-->>F: Request rejects with stopSignal
    Note over F: Previously abort was false and generic failure escaped
  else Frontend handler observed first
    F->>F: Abort stop signal
    C-->>F: Request rejects
  end
  Note over F: Classify from abort OR child stopSignal
  alt Preflight
    F->>F: Cancel before cleanup, exit 130 or 143
  else Down
    F->>F: Report stopping, retain prepared intent and interrupted-stop guidance
  end
